{"seq":3,"slug":"rate-limit-ux","title":"限流用户体验：配额可视化、错误提示与预防引导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/frontend/rate-limit-ux","wordCount":798,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"限流用户体验-配额可视化-错误提示与预防引导\">限流用户体验：配额可视化、错误提示与预防引导</h1><p>限流触发时，用户体验设计的好坏决定了用户是困惑离开还是理解等待。好的限流 UX 遵循三个原则：<strong>让用户知道发生了什么</strong>（透明）、<strong>告诉用户能做什么</strong>（可行动）、<strong>帮助用户避免再次触发</strong>（预防）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>限流 UX 遵循三个设计原则：<strong>透明</strong>（让用户知道发生了什么）、<strong>可行动</strong>（告诉用户能做什么）、<strong>预防</strong>（帮助用户避免再次触发）。好的限流错误提示包含四要素：发生了什么 + 为什么 + 何时恢复 + 能做什么。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[限流触发] --&gt; B{自动处理?}&#10;    B -- 短暂速率限制 --&gt; C[静默排队&lt;br/&gt;用户无感]&#10;    B -- 配额耗尽 --&gt; D[展示错误提示&lt;br/&gt;四要素齐全]&#10;    D --&gt; E{用户套餐}&#10;    E -- 免费 --&gt; F[升级引导&lt;br/&gt;转化机会]&#10;    E -- 付费 --&gt; G[重置倒计时&lt;br/&gt;恢复预期]&#10;    C --&gt; H[自动重试成功]&#10;    F --&gt; I[用户决策]&#10;    G --&gt; J[等待恢复]\">graph LR\n    A[限流触发] --&gt; B{自动处理?}\n    B -- 短暂速率限制 --&gt; C[静默排队&lt;br/&gt;用户无感]\n    B -- 配额耗尽 --&gt; D[展示错误提示&lt;br/&gt;四要素齐全]\n    D --&gt; E{用户套餐}\n    E -- 免费 --&gt; F[升级引导&lt;br/&gt;转化机会]\n    E -- 付费 --&gt; G[重置倒计时&lt;br/&gt;恢复预期]\n    C --&gt; H[自动重试成功]\n    F --&gt; I[用户决策]\n    G --&gt; J[等待恢复]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限流类型</th>\n<th>UX 策略</th>\n<th>是否自动重试</th>\n<th>核心信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速率限制（短暂）</td>\n<td>静默排队，用户无感</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无需展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日配额（免费用户）</td>\n<td>升级引导 + 重置倒计时</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>升级方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日配额（付费用户）</td>\n<td>仅显示重置时间</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>恢复时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP 限流（安全）</td>\n<td>等待提示，不提供绕过</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>等待时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"错误提示设计原则\">错误提示设计原则</h2><h3 id=\"错误信息的四要素\">错误信息的四要素</h3><p>一个有效的限流错误提示需要包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"[发生了什么] + [为什么] + [什么时候恢复] + [现在能做什么]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[发生了什么] + [为什么] + [什么时候恢复] + [现在能做什么]</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>差的示例</th>\n<th>好的示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发生了什么</td>\n<td>&quot;Error 429&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;请求频率超出限制&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为什么</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>&quot;您的免费套餐每分钟最多 10 次请求&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>什么时候恢复</td>\n<td>&quot;请稍后&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;45 秒后自动恢复&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现在能做什么</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>&quot;升级套餐获得更高配额 / 等待恢复&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"错误提示组件\">错误提示组件</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function RateLimitNotice({ error, onRetry }) {&#10;  const [countdown, setCountdown] = useState(error.retryAfter);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (countdown &lt;= 0) return;&#10;    const timer = setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;      setCountdown((c) =&gt; {&#10;        if (c &lt;= 1) {&#10;          clearInterval(timer);&#10;          onRetry?.();&#10;          return 0;&#10;        }&#10;        return c - 1;&#10;      });&#10;    }, 1000);&#10;    return () =&gt; clearInterval(timer);&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;rate-limit-notice&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;notice-icon&quot;&gt;{/* 使用图标而非文字描述状态 */}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;notice-content&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;strong&gt;请求频率超出限制&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;&#10;          您的 &lt;span className=&quot;tier-badge&quot;&gt;{error.tier}&lt;/span&gt; 套餐 每分钟最多 {error.limit} 次请求&#10;        &lt;/p&gt;&#10;        {countdown &gt; 0 ? (&#10;          &lt;p className=&quot;countdown&quot;&gt;&#10;            &lt;span className=&quot;countdown-number&quot;&gt;{countdown}&lt;/span&gt; 秒后自动重试&#10;          &lt;/p&gt;&#10;        ) : (&#10;          &lt;button onClick={onRetry} className=&quot;retry-btn&quot;&gt;&#10;            立即重试&#10;          &lt;/button&gt;&#10;        )}&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      {error.tier === &#39;free&#39; &amp;&amp; (&#10;        &lt;a href=&quot;/pricing&quot; className=&quot;upgrade-link&quot;&gt;&#10;          升级套餐，获得更高配额&#10;        &lt;/a&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function RateLimitNotice({ error, onRetry }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [countdown, setCountdown] = useState(error.retryAfter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (countdown &#x3C;= 0) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const timer = setInterval(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setCountdown((c) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (c &#x3C;= 1) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          clearInterval(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          onRetry?.();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          return 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return c - 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }, 1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => clearInterval(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"rate-limit-notice\" role=\"alert\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"notice-icon\">{/* 使用图标而非文字描述状态 */}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"notice-content\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;strong>请求频率超出限制&#x3C;/strong></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          您的 &#x3C;span className=\"tier-badge\">{error.tier}&#x3C;/span> 套餐 每分钟最多 {error.limit} 次请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {countdown > 0 ? (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;p className=\"countdown\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;span className=\"countdown-number\">{countdown}&#x3C;/span> 秒后自动重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) : (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;button onClick={onRetry} className=\"retry-btn\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            立即重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {error.tier === 'free' &#x26;&#x26; (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;a href=\"/pricing\" className=\"upgrade-link\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          升级套餐，获得更高配额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/a></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"配额可视化\">配额可视化</h2><p>让用户实时感知配额消耗，比等到 429 再告知更好：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function QuotaIndicator({ remaining, limit, resetAt }) {&#10;  const percentage = remaining / limit;&#10;  const isLow = percentage &lt; 0.2;&#10;  const isVeryLow = percentage &lt; 0.05;&#10;&#10;  const resetIn = formatDistanceToNow(resetAt * 1000, { locale: zhCN });&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className={`quota-indicator ${isLow ? &#39;low&#39; : &#39;&#39;} ${isVeryLow ? &#39;critical&#39; : &#39;&#39;}`}&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;quota-bar&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;quota-fill&quot; style={{ width: `${percentage * 100}%` }} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;div className=&quot;quota-text&quot;&gt;&#10;        {isVeryLow ? (&#10;          &lt;span className=&quot;warning&quot;&gt;&#10;            仅剩 {remaining} 次请求，{resetIn}后重置&#10;          &lt;/span&gt;&#10;        ) : (&#10;          &lt;span&gt;&#10;            剩余 {remaining}/{limit} 次请求&#10;          &lt;/span&gt;&#10;        )}&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function QuotaIndicator({ remaining, limit, resetAt }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const percentage = remaining / limit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const isLow = percentage &#x3C; 0.2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const isVeryLow = percentage &#x3C; 0.05;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const resetIn = formatDistanceToNow(resetAt * 1000, { locale: zhCN });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className={`quota-indicator ${isLow ? 'low' : ''} ${isVeryLow ? 'critical' : ''}`}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"quota-bar\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"quota-fill\" style={{ width: `${percentage * 100}%` }} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div className=\"quota-text\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {isVeryLow ? (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;span className=\"warning\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            仅剩 {remaining} 次请求，{resetIn}后重置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) : (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            剩余 {remaining}/{limit} 次请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"配额数据来源\">配额数据来源</h3><p>从每个 API 响应的 Header 中提取配额信息，并存入全局状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// Axios 拦截器：自动提取配额信息&#10;api.interceptors.response.use(&#10;  (response) =&gt; {&#10;    const remaining = Number(response.headers[&#39;x-ratelimit-remaining&#39;]);&#10;    const limit = Number(response.headers[&#39;x-ratelimit-limit&#39;]);&#10;    const resetAt = Number(response.headers[&#39;x-ratelimit-reset&#39;]);&#10;&#10;    if (!isNaN(remaining) &amp;&amp; !isNaN(limit)) {&#10;      store.dispatch(updateQuota({ remaining, limit, resetAt }));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return response;&#10;  },&#10;  (error) =&gt; {&#10;    if (error.response?.status === 429) {&#10;      const retryAfter = Number(error.response.headers[&#39;retry-after&#39;]) || 60;&#10;      store.dispatch(setRateLimited({ retryAfter }));&#10;    }&#10;    return Promise.reject(error);&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Axios 拦截器：自动提取配额信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">api.interceptors.response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> remaining</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response.headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-ratelimit-remaining'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response.headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-ratelimit-limit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resetAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response.headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-ratelimit-reset'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isNaN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(remaining) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isNaN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(limit)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">updateQuota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ remaining, limit, resetAt }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error.response?.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 429</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> retryAfter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error.response.headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'retry-after'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      store.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dispatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setRateLimited</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ retryAfter }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预防引导-帮助用户避免触发限流\">预防引导：帮助用户避免触发限流</h2><p>最好的限流 UX 是让用户意识不到限流存在。在用户行为导致高频请求之前主动引导：</p>\n<h3 id=\"搜索框输入提示\">搜索框输入提示</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function SmartSearchBox({ onSearch }) {&#10;  const { remaining, limit } = useQuota();&#10;  const isLow = remaining &lt; limit * 0.1;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;search-container&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;input&#10;        placeholder={isLow ? &#39;配额不足，请减少搜索频率&#39; : &#39;搜索...&#39;}&#10;        onChange={debounce(onSearch, isLow ? 800 : 300)}&#10;      /&gt;&#10;      {isLow &amp;&amp; &lt;div className=&quot;quota-warning&quot;&gt;剩余 {remaining} 次搜索配额，已自动降低搜索频率&lt;/div&gt;}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function SmartSearchBox({ onSearch }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { remaining, limit } = useQuota();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const isLow = remaining &#x3C; limit * 0.1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"search-container\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        placeholder={isLow ? '配额不足，请减少搜索频率' : '搜索...'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onChange={debounce(onSearch, isLow ? 800 : 300)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {isLow &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;div className=\"quota-warning\">剩余 {remaining} 次搜索配额，已自动降低搜索频率&#x3C;/div>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"批量操作前的配额检查\">批量操作前的配额检查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function BulkActionButton({ items, onAction }) {&#10;  const { remaining } = useQuota();&#10;  const costEstimate = items.length;&#10;  const insufficient = costEstimate &gt; remaining;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;button&#10;      disabled={insufficient}&#10;      title={insufficient ? `此操作需要 ${costEstimate} 次配额，您仅剩 ${remaining} 次` : undefined}&#10;      onClick={onAction}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      批量处理 ({items.length} 项)&#10;      {insufficient &amp;&amp; &lt;span className=&quot;quota-badge&quot;&gt;配额不足&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function BulkActionButton({ items, onAction }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { remaining } = useQuota();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const costEstimate = items.length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const insufficient = costEstimate > remaining;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;button</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      disabled={insufficient}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      title={insufficient ? `此操作需要 ${costEstimate} 次配额，您仅剩 ${remaining} 次` : undefined}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onClick={onAction}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      批量处理 ({items.length} 项)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {insufficient &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span className=\"quota-badge\">配额不足&#x3C;/span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"不同限流类型的-ux-策略\">不同限流类型的 UX 策略</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[收到 429] --&gt; B{限流类型}&#10;    B -- &quot;速率限制&lt;br/&gt;(短时过快)&quot; --&gt; C[自动等待重试&lt;br/&gt;用户无感]&#10;    B -- &quot;日配额耗尽&lt;br/&gt;(免费用户)&quot; --&gt; D[展示升级引导&lt;br/&gt;显示重置时间]&#10;    B -- &quot;日配额耗尽&lt;br/&gt;(付费用户)&quot; --&gt; E[展示重置时间&lt;br/&gt;可选联系支持]&#10;    B -- &quot;接口级限流&lt;br/&gt;(安全保护)&quot; --&gt; F[明确提示等待&lt;br/&gt;不提供绕过方式]&#10;    C --&gt; G[静默重试成功]&#10;    D --&gt; H[用户升级或等待]&#10;    E --&gt; I[用户等待或联系支持]&#10;    F --&gt; J[冷却后恢复]\">graph TD\n    A[收到 429] --&gt; B{限流类型}\n    B -- \"速率限制&lt;br/&gt;(短时过快)\" --&gt; C[自动等待重试&lt;br/&gt;用户无感]\n    B -- \"日配额耗尽&lt;br/&gt;(免费用户)\" --&gt; D[展示升级引导&lt;br/&gt;显示重置时间]\n    B -- \"日配额耗尽&lt;br/&gt;(付费用户)\" --&gt; E[展示重置时间&lt;br/&gt;可选联系支持]\n    B -- \"接口级限流&lt;br/&gt;(安全保护)\" --&gt; F[明确提示等待&lt;br/&gt;不提供绕过方式]\n    C --&gt; G[静默重试成功]\n    D --&gt; H[用户升级或等待]\n    E --&gt; I[用户等待或联系支持]\n    F --&gt; J[冷却后恢复]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限流类型</th>\n<th>UX 策略</th>\n<th>是否自动重试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速率限制（短暂）</td>\n<td>静默排队，用户无感</td>\n<td>是，自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日配额（免费用户）</td>\n<td>升级引导 + 重置倒计时</td>\n<td>否，需用户决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日配额（付费用户）</td>\n<td>仅显示重置时间</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP/设备限流（安全）</td>\n<td>解释等待时间，不提供绕过</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加载状态与骨架屏\">加载状态与骨架屏</h2><p>限流触发降级时，骨架屏（Skeleton Screen）比空白更友好：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function DataCard({ data, loading, rateLimited, stale }) {&#10;  if (loading) return &lt;SkeletonCard /&gt;;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className={`data-card ${stale ? &#39;stale&#39; : &#39;&#39;}`}&gt;&#10;      {stale &amp;&amp; (&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;stale-indicator&quot; title=&quot;数据可能不是最新的&quot;&gt;&#10;          显示缓存数据&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;      {rateLimited &amp;&amp; &lt;div className=&quot;rate-limited-banner&quot;&gt;实时数据暂不可用，正在显示缓存内容&lt;/div&gt;}&#10;      &lt;DataContent data={data} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function DataCard({ data, loading, rateLimited, stale }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (loading) return &#x3C;SkeletonCard />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className={`data-card ${stale ? 'stale' : ''}`}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {stale &#x26;&#x26; (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"stale-indicator\" title=\"数据可能不是最新的\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          显示缓存数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {rateLimited &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;div className=\"rate-limited-banner\">实时数据暂不可用，正在显示缓存内容&#x3C;/div>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;DataContent data={data} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>错误提示四要素：发生了什么 + 为什么 + 何时恢复 + 能做什么——缺一不可</li>\n<li>配额可视化让用户提前感知限制，比被突然拒绝体验更好</li>\n<li>不同限流类型对应不同 UX 策略：速率限制静默处理，配额耗尽需要用户决策</li>\n<li>骨架屏和「缓存数据」标注在降级场景下优于空白页面</li>\n<li>预防引导（配额感知的搜索延迟、批量操作前的检查）是最优雅的限流 UX</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>兄弟文档：<a href=\"graceful-degradation\">优雅降级</a> 讲降级的技术实现；<a href=\"../patterns/user-tier-quota\">用户分级配额</a> 介绍服务端如何生成配额信息供前端展示。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"限流用户体验：配额可视化、错误提示与预防引导","id":"限流用户体验-配额可视化-错误提示与预防引导"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"错误提示设计原则","id":"错误提示设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"错误信息的四要素","id":"错误信息的四要素"},{"level":3,"text":"错误提示组件","id":"错误提示组件"},{"level":2,"text":"配额可视化","id":"配额可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"配额数据来源","id":"配额数据来源"},{"level":2,"text":"预防引导：帮助用户避免触发限流","id":"预防引导-帮助用户避免触发限流"},{"level":3,"text":"搜索框输入提示","id":"搜索框输入提示"},{"level":3,"text":"批量操作前的配额检查","id":"批量操作前的配额检查"},{"level":2,"text":"不同限流类型的 UX 策略","id":"不同限流类型的-ux-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"加载状态与骨架屏","id":"加载状态与骨架屏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"优雅降级：当限流触发时减少功能损失","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/frontend/graceful-degradation"},"next":null}